'''Apayao's at-large congressional district''' refers to the lone [[congressional district of the Philippines]] in the province of [[Apayao]]. It has been represented in the [[House of Representatives of the Philippines]] since 1998. It was previously included in [[Kalinga-Apayao's at-large congressional district]] from 1969 to 1998. The district is currently represented in the [[20th Congress of the Philippines|20th Congress]] by [[Eleonor Bulut Begtang]] of the [[Nationalist People's Coalition]] (NPC).<ref name="congmem">{{Cite web |title=House Members |url=http://www.congress.gov.ph/members/ |access-date=April 21, 2023 |publisher=[[House of Representatives of the Philippines]]}}</ref>

